NAME

	pll - Print out the linked list concatenation.

SYNOPSIS

	pll [-hv]

	-h
		Display syntax help.

	-v
		Print verbose information.

DESCRIPTION

	Print out the linked list concatenation.
	If the -v option is specified, also print out the VOLSER

EXIT VALUES

	0
		Success

	Other
		Error, see message for details

SEE ALSO

	pparm(1), pproc(1)
